    "slug": "how-to-hide-photos-on-iphone",
    "title": "How to Hide Photos on iPhone: Lock and Find Them",
    "description": "Learn to hide and lock iPhone photos, find the Hidden album, check iCloud privacy, and manage duplicates, vaults, and backups.",
    "category": "Privacy Guides",
    "author": "Lena Hart",
    "authorRole": "Privacy Editor",
