    "slug": "trusted-contacts-explained",
    "title": "Trusted Contacts App Recovery: A Practical Guide",
    "description": "Understand trusted contacts app recovery, Apple and Google options, encrypted vault recovery, backup needs, and protection against scams.",
    "category": "Feature Deep-Dives",
