    "slug": "veilo-pro-max-cloud-backup",
    "title": "Encrypted Cloud Backup for Photos: Veilo Pro Max",
    "description": "Understand encrypted photo backup, compare privacy models, and learn how to verify Veilo Pro Max backups and plan safe recovery.",
    "category": "Product Updates",
