    "title": "How to Hide Photos on Android: Locked Folder and More",
    "description": "Learn how to hide photos on Android using Locked Folder, Samsung Secure Folder, Private space, or an encrypted vault, with backup checks.",
    "category": "Privacy Guides",
    "author": "Marco Reyes",
