    "title": "Photo Vault App Guide 2026: Compare Privacy and Recovery",
    "description": "Choose a photo vault app with clear encryption, locks, recovery, and export. Compare built-in tools, Keepsafe, Private Photo Vault, Ente, and Veilo.",
    "category": "Privacy Guides",
